  "text": "We assemble the proposal as a single PDF of at most 20 pages, submit it through the College's procurement portal by 2026-12-01 12:00 UTC, and ensure the service goes live for students by 2027-01-11, the first day of spring enrollment [APP-001]. Portal availability is an assumption [APP-001]. We maintain an audit record of every signature event, capturing the signer's identity, time, and document version, and store signed documents for ten years [APP-002], though the storage medium is an assumption [APP-002]. We support signing on current desktop and mobile browsers, and send a reminder to each signer who has not signed within 72 hours [APP-003]. The reminder communication channel is an assumption [APP-003]. We integrate the service with the College's student records system via its existing REST API, maintaining a service availability of 99.5% in each calendar month, excluding planned maintenance announced five working days in advance [APP-004]. Monitoring tools are assumed [APP-004].",
